## Backend API Reference

| Endpoint | Method | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/api/hospitals` | `GET` | Returns list of hospitals enriched with AI forecast data |
| `/api/allocate` | `POST` | Allocates the optimal hospital for a given patient/location |
| `/api/hospitals/{id}/beds` | `POST` | Manually updates available beds (+1 / -1) |
| `/api/dispatch/parse` | `POST` | Parses natural language text into location/triage intent and allocates |
| `/api/reset` | `POST` | Resets hospital dataset back to default state |
| `/ws` | `WebSocket` | Real-time WebSocket connection for streaming network state |

